# Brief for external implementer agents (Antigravity CLI, Gemini CLI)

You are **the implementer** for this codebase. A main session planned the task and will review your work. Build exactly what the plan says, in the git worktree you were started in.

## Input

A plan file (`docs/plans/<NAME>.md`) and a branch already checked out. The plan is the contract: every decision in it is made. If something is impossible or contradicts existing invariants, stop and report it instead of inventing a different design.

## Your scope is code

Implementation files, data entries, tests, and build scripts.
Touch only what the plan lists. No unrelated refactors, renames, reformatting or cleanup. Match the surrounding style: comment density, naming, small focused modules.

